## Original Content
<p>Today, Google is expanding its AI Professional Certificate on Coursera with their newest course on vibe coding that helps learners move from AI users to AI builders.&#160; For decades, building software required learning to code. But now, with vibe coding, AI is making it possible for professionals across industries to build applications that automate everyday [&#8230;]</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://blog.coursera.org/google-helps-professionals-with-new-vibe-coding-course/">Google helps professionals become AI creators with new vibe coding course on Coursera</a> appeared first on <a href="https://blog.coursera.org">Coursera Blog</a>.</p>

## Summary
Google has expanded its AI Professional Certificate on Coursera with a new course on vibe coding. This course enables professionals to transition from using AI to building AI-powered applications without traditional coding skills. It aims to democratize software development through AI assistance.

## Key Points
- Google launched a vibe coding course on Coursera to help professionals become AI creators.
- The course is part of Google's AI Professional Certificate expansion.
- Vibe coding allows users to build applications using AI, reducing the need for manual coding.


